---
// The figure of the Transaction groups room: the open / quiescing / syncing
// pipeline, run by the model in src/lib/txg.ts (the two threads of txg.c and
// their wait conditions; the code each event stands for is listed in
// ANALYSIS.md, room "Transaction groups"). The narration is plain and has no
// code links: the room's Source notes carry them (D21.1, D24.1). What the model
// simplifies: DECISIONS.md D3.1.
